# 烟雾模拟项目核心技术算法实现总结
# Smoke Simulation Project - Core Technical Algorithm Implementation Summary

## 项目概述 / Project Overview

这是一个基于GPU计算着色器的2D烟雾流体模拟系统，使用Unity引擎实现。项目采用经典的Stable Fluids算法，通过压力投影法求解不可压缩流体方程，实现了实时、交互式的烟雾效果。

This is a GPU compute shader-based 2D smoke fluid simulation system implemented in Unity. The project uses the classic Stable Fluids algorithm, solving the incompressible fluid equations through pressure projection, achieving real-time, interactive smoke effects.

